### Ready-to-run requests for IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code "REST Client".
### Start the API first (mvn spring-boot:run). In the default dev profile the admin API is open;
### with require-admin-login=true add:  Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46Y2hhbmdlLW1l   (admin:change-me)

@host = http://localhost:8080

### ---- Storefront (public) ----
GET {{host}}/api/products

###
GET {{host}}/api/products?department=Men&category=Hoodies

###
GET {{host}}/api/products/KF-001

###
GET {{host}}/api/categories

### Checkout: prices are NOT sent; the server looks them up
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": { "name": "Ananya R.", "email": "ananya@example.com", "phone": "+91 98765 43210", "address": "12 MG Road, Madurai" },
  "items": [ { "productId": "KF-003", "quantity": 1, "size": "M" } ]
}

### ---- Admin ----
GET {{host}}/api/admin/stats

###
GET {{host}}/api/admin/products?q=&status=&sort=newest&page=0&size=20

###
POST {{host}}/api/admin/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ivory Anarkali", "category": "Salwar Suits", "price": 3499, "stock": 8,
  "image": "/uploads/replace-me.jpg", "description": "Hand-finished festive wear", "status": "Published" }

###
PUT {{host}}/api/admin/products/KF-013
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ivory Anarkali", "category": "Salwar Suits", "price": 3299, "stock": 6, "status": "Published" }

###
PATCH {{host}}/api/admin/products/KF-013/stock
Content-Type: application/json

{ "stock": 20 }

###
DELETE {{host}}/api/admin/products/KF-013

###
GET {{host}}/api/admin/orders?status=Processing&page=0&size=20

###
GET {{host}}/api/admin/orders/ORD-1043

###
PATCH {{host}}/api/admin/orders/ORD-1043/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Shipped" }

### ---- Uploads ----
POST {{host}}/api/uploads
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=kfboundary

--kfboundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="photo.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./photo.jpg
--kfboundary--

###
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me

###
GET {{host}}/actuator/health
